   "source": [
    "# Tensors"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "d8d5f2fb",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "A tensor is simply a way of representing data in multiple dimensions.\n",
    "\n",
    "You can think of tensors as a generalization of:\n",
    "\n",
    "|Object\t|Dimensions|\n",
    "|---|---|\n",
    "|calar |(single number)\t|0D|\n",
    "|Vector |(list of numbers)|\t1D|\n",
    "|Matrix |(table of numbers)|\t2D|\n",
    "|Tensor|\t3D, 4D, 5D, ...|"
   ]
  }
 ],
